# .mcp.json and CLAUDE.md define what the demo agent may do.
/.claude/
**/.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md
/CLAUDE.md
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.aider*
graphify-out/

